// BITSAdmin Download
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_bitsadmin_download.yml (77f85f06-4743-4b88-b09f-86bb2e3adc60)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1197 BITS Jobs, T1105 Ingress Tool Transfer
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"1") and (process.executable:"*\\bitsadmin.exe" and (process.command_line like~ ("*/transfer*", "*/addfile*")) and process.command_line:"*http*")
